source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: Jira renders a brace-form Text Effect inside a Monospace Span, so inline code conversion warns and keeps the characters literal.
-- input.jira --
{{a{*}b{*}c}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>a<b>b</b>c</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`a{*}b{*}c`
-- warnings.json --
[
  {
    "Line": 1,
    "Column": 1,
    "Construct": "inline-code",
    "Reason": "Jira would render a bold effect inside this Monospace Span; inline code keeps the characters literal"
  }
]
